# .mailmap — canonical author names/addresses for `git log`, `git shortlog` and `git blame`.
#
# The history is public, tagged and archived on Zenodo, so it cannot be rewritten; this file
# only changes how the existing author entries are DISPLAYED. Rules: map every personal or
# machine-generated address of a known person to one canonical entry; never invent addresses.
# Contributors: commit with an address verified on your GitHub account (see CONTRIBUTING.md).
#
# Derived from `git log --all --format='%an <%ae>' | sort -u` on 2026-09-07.

# Marcel Susky — canonical: the institutional address present in the history.
Marcel Susky <marcel.susky@tu-dresden.de> M. Susky <31925243+msusky@users.noreply.github.com>

